{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國《第34屆大韓民國文化演藝大賞》昨晚在首爾一間酒店舉行，頒發文化及演藝界別的多個獎項，最高榮譽的「大獎」由入行65年的84歲老牌女星鄭惠允獲得，至於男星朴珍榮與女星南智賢就獲得劇集部門的「最優秀男、女演員獎」，「優秀男、女演員獎」則由男</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.388924+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:02:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.028095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.028095+00:00","content_hash":"900121896ae650a1eb4a02c81e2d821b4e9957f2aa8d8a88de1c66ad6ea0adca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}